      "heading": "The short version",
      "html": "<ul><li>RF exposure at radio sites is judged against ICNIRP guidelines.</li><li>Since 2021, Ofcom has asked operators of radio equipment above a power threshold to show EMF compliance.</li><li>Work near live antennas uses zones, permits, power-down and signs. A competent RF assessor sets them.</li><li>Quickler records the evidence and writes the report. It does not measure RF or replace an RF assessment.</li></ul>"
    },
